																		Pleased to Meat You
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weryllium" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2727655); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2727655&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606250388" alt="Weryllium" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2727655)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weryllium" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2727655); return false;" >Weryllium</a></span> <span class="odate time_1521521190 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">20 Mar 2018 04:46</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3744156">
									

<p>This is a historic moment. To my knowledge, this is the first direct Xmas gifter-giftee collab! More personally, it's my first exploration and my longest work ever (for now!)</p>
<p>Our story begins on a cold December morning. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581634179" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;">DarkStuff</a></span> had been selected as my gift recipient for the Christmas Exchange. I was moved by the selflessness of his request and wrote him a little something. He was very happy to receive it but did note many areas that could be improved. So we agreed to a collab, that my idea and his skills could be combined to make this work what it was always destined to be.</p>
<p>Fast forward a few months. After both tying up loose ends, we sat down and hammered out this draft together. I had a blast working with Stuff for this, and I hope you have as much fun reading as we did writing.</p>
<p>Big thanks to <span class="error-inline"><em>9Volt</em> does not match any existing user name</span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581634179" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;">Captain Kirby</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cadavercommander" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3187823); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3187823&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581634179" alt="CadaverCommander" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3187823)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cadavercommander" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3187823); return false;">CadaverCommander</a></span> for crit.</p>
<p>Do enjoy your visit.</p>
<p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Noaa-walrus29.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Noaa-walrus29.jpg</a> public domain</p>

